msgid "Put f before the quotes and any {expression} inside is replaced by its value. After a colon comes the look: {price:.2f} keeps two decimals, {count:>5} pads to five places, {share:.0%} shows a percentage.\n\nText has methods: name.upper(), line.split(\",\"), \", \".join(names), text.replace(\"a\", \"b\"), word.startswith(\"Iron\"). len(text) counts letters, text[0] is the first one."
