msgid "range(n) gives 0 … n-1. range(a, b) starts at a and stops before b. A third number is the step: range(3, 9, 2) is 3, 5, 7; a negative step counts down.\n\nThe stop value is never included – range(5) has five numbers and the last one is 4."
